{
  "identifier": "main-window",
  "description": "The only capability granted to the app. It is limited to the trusted Anvil main window and to the host commands that window actually uses: preferences, the diagnostic log line and the phase-1 catalog (discovery, sync, custom model, verification, MCP probe, runtime install). Event listen/unlisten is needed for the system-theme push; and the phase-2 chat session commands (open, send, stream, stop, history).",
